flowchart TB
  Goal --> Planner
  Planner --> ReadOnly[Research / review: read-only intent]
  Planner --> Consequential[Worker: workspace write]
  Consequential --> Gate{Approval policy}
  Gate -->|approved| Execute[Execute scoped action]
  Gate -->|rejected| Stop[Reject and audit]
  Execute --> Verify[Independent verification]
  ReadOnly --> Verify
